			optional: true,
			title: "A Chef: the Kitchen",
			description: ["A varied diet (three or more kinds of meal) makes villagers happier. Build the Kitchen, a little house with a smoker. Get its blueprint at the Blueprint Table (pick it, press Get Blueprint: it takes a Blank Blueprint), right-click the ground where its front goes, stock the chests within 8 blocks of the table with what the blueprint lists when you hold Shift over it, and right-click your builder with it.", "", "Sneak-right-click a villager by the smoker holding raw meat, raw fish or a potato: they become a Chef, and everything they cook goes into the store."],
